{'symbol': 'PENN', 'date': '2021-11-04 07:00:00', 'title': 'PENN NATIONAL GAMING REPORTS THIRD QUARTER REVENUES OF $1.5 BILLION, NET INCOME OF $86.1 MILLION, ADJUSTED EBITDAR OF $480.3 MILLION, AND ADJUSTED EBITDA OF $364.3 MILLION', 'text': 'WYOMISSING, PA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PENN NATIONAL GAMING, INC. (NASDAQ: PENN) (“PENN NATIONAL” OR THE “COMPANY”) TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE THREE AND NINE MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2021. 2021 THIRD QUARTER FINANCIAL HIGHLIGHTS: REVENUES OF $1.5 BILLION, AN INCREASE OF $382.1 MILLION YEAR OVER YEAR AND $157.3 MILLION VERSUS 2019; NET INCOME OF $86.1 MILLION AND NET INCOME MARGIN OF 5.7%, AS COMPARED TO $141.2 MILLION AND 12.5%, RESPECTIVELY, IN THE PRIOR YEAR AND NET INCOME OF $43.7'}